  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "An array A=[A1,A2,…,AN]A = [A_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_N]A=[A1​,A2​,…,AN​] is said to be good when the following condition holds:\n\n\nFor every pair of subsets XXX and YYY of indices in the range [1,N][1, N][1,N], such that ∣X∣&lt;∣Y∣|X| &lt; |Y|∣X∣&lt;∣Y∣, it holds that the sum of elements in XXX is **strictly smaller** than the sum of elements in YYY.\n\nMore formally, it should hold that ∑i∈XAi&lt;∑i∈YAi\\sum_{i \\in X}A_i &lt; \\sum_{i \\in Y}A_i∑i∈X​Ai​&lt;∑i∈Y​Ai​.\nFor example, [2,2,3][2, 2, 3][2,2,3] is a good array and we can verify this condition. But, [2,2,4][2, 2, 4][2,2,4] is not because consider X={3}X = \\{3\\}X={3} and Y={1,2}Y = \\{1, 2\\}Y={1,2}. ∑i∈XAi=4\\sum_{i \\in X}A_i = 4∑i∈X​Ai​=4 and ∑i∈YAi=2+2=4\\sum_{i \\in Y}A_i = 2 + 2 = 4∑i∈Y​Ai​=2+2=4. Both have the same sum 444 despite XXX having fewer elements, and this contradicts the condition.\n\nYou are given an array AAA of NNN integers.\n\nFind the number of non-empty subsequences of the array AAA which are good.\n\nA subsequence is an array formed by deleting some (possibly none) elements from the array, but without changing the order of the remaining elements. Note that there are 2N−12^N - 12N−1 possible non-empty subsequences of an array with NNN integers.\n\nNote: For a set SSS, ∣S∣|S|∣S∣ denotes the cardinality or size of the set SSS.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains a single integer NNN - the size of the array.\nThe second line contains NNN integers - A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nOutput the number of good subsequences of AAA.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤N≤601 \\le N \\le 601≤N≤60",
      "1≤Ai≤N1 \\le A_i \\le N1≤Ai​≤N",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 1 (5 points):** A1=A2=…=ANA_1 = A_2 = \\ldots = A_NA1​=A2​=…=AN​",
      "**Subtask 2 (12 points):** N≤8N \\le 8N≤8",
      "**Subtask 3 (10 points):** N≤18N \\le 18N≤18",
      "**Subtask 4 (13 points):** There are at most 333 distinct values in the array AAA.",
      "**Subtask 5 (32 points):** N≤30N \\le 30N≤30",
      "**Subtask 6 (28 points):** No additional constraints"
    ],
